msgid ""
"Another Rufus application is running.\n"
"Please close the first application before running another one."
msgstr ""
"Program Rufus je jiz spusteny.\n"
"Prosim zavrete bezici aplikaci pred opetovnym spustenim."

#. • MSG_003
msgid ""
"WARNING: ALL DATA ON DEVICE '%s' WILL BE DESTROYED.\n"
"To continue with this operation, click OK. To quit click CANCEL."
msgstr ""
"VAROVANI: VSECHNA DATA NA CILOVEM DISKU %s. BUDOU SMAZANA\n"
"Chcete-li pokracovat v teto operaci, kliknete na tlacitko OK.\n"
"Pro zruseni kliknete na tlacitko ZRUSIT."

